# Kefka, Court Mage: a card type is counted once however many discarded cards have it, and the trigger happens on each attack too.
# Turn 1 it enters: both discard a land, one type, so Bot1 draws one card. Turn 3 it attacks: Bot1 discards a Swamp and Bot2 an
# Ornithopter (an artifact creature), three types among them, one of them a land: land, artifact and creature, so Bot1 draws three.

